  "RQ5 mitigations": "Decentralized consensus averaging broadcasted and sensed data; consensus-based filtering rejecting outlier travel times; iterations until no error message",
  "author_limitations (verbatim)": "The current simulation scenario is relatively simple. The current study focused on a simple cyberattack that modified broadcasted speed and location data.",
